                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bcd8604a-8358-31d7-a139-ddb39346aec2",
                        "entry_id": "94da50e5-1ad5-3cce-94b6-cc21db50eb4e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "человек, любящий вкусную еду, сладости"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d8e5426-02ef-43a1-8e78-5fe04c1eb67a",
                                "sense_id": "bcd8604a-8358-31d7-a139-ddb39346aec2",
                                "text": "Николинька не играл в мяч и не бегал взапуски, он был сластена, лакомка, и нежная тетка его закармливала."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20323901-61bf-42c9-9e09-b45a8549eaf3",
                                "sense_id": "bcd8604a-8358-31d7-a139-ddb39346aec2",
                                "text": "Гортензия была лакомкой, обожала парфюмерию, сериалы и жила в свое удовольствие."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8001be57-73bb-4ca5-8e0f-d37216ad1ff0",
                        "source_entry_id": "94da50e5-1ad5-3cce-94b6-cc21db50eb4e",
                        "source_sense_id": "bcd8604a-8358-31d7-a139-ddb39346aec2",
                        "target_lang_word": "gourmand",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gourmand",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                        "entry_id": "665b4e52-a5fb-3ffe-be0d-2918482d4cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person given to excess in the consumption of food and drink; a greedy or ravenous eater."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98b9015f-6642-4eb5-8c60-f0fc00b1c40f",
                                                "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                                "text": "I knew him, at Caivs trencher, when for hyre, / He proſtituted his abuſed body / To that great gourmond, fat Apicivs;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6850d1a-2d3c-495b-86b6-f4ecab747eeb",
                                                "sense_id": "40cceae9-5c26-37a5-b9dc-3f5be9d4e44c",
                                                "text": "The colonel and his sponsor made a queer contrast: Greystone [the sponsor] long and stringy, with a face that seemed as if a cold wind was eternally playing on it. […] But there was not a more lascivious reprobate and gourmand in all London than this same Greystone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a05caa91-a6b2-3eeb-82bd-48dc1500f960",
                                        "entry_id": "665b4e52-a5fb-3ffe-be0d-2918482d4cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who appreciates good food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa55b460-2e6c-4e05-b08a-5d5c72af98e7",
                                                "sense_id": "a05caa91-a6b2-3eeb-82bd-48dc1500f960",
                                                "text": "The third key was the number of demands from different patrons or groups for their own specialized cuisines. Such patrons included the court, rich households, and scholar-gourmands. Buddhists and Muslims also elaborated their own cuisines (sucai 素菜 and qingzhen 清真)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54b6e134-ec88-4737-b5c3-03ab522358ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "94da50e5-1ad5-3cce-94b6-cc21db50eb4e",
                        "source_sense_id": "bcd8604a-8358-31d7-a139-ddb39346aec2",
                        "target_lang_word": "gourmet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gourmet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ecb1d1d-f78a-3439-bd58-d04af47ada12",
                                        "entry_id": "d24d1366-eb60-39d0-8804-22f72260b91c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fine; of superior quality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3eb5549-50bf-40b1-8115-1d32b39b4194",
                                                "sense_id": "2ecb1d1d-f78a-3439-bd58-d04af47ada12",
                                                "text": "We need to go to the gourmet grocery store to get the exotic ingredients for this recipe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1330b9c6-491e-47a0-b449-cb4c5b5dc8b2",
                                                "sense_id": "2ecb1d1d-f78a-3439-bd58-d04af47ada12",
                                                "text": "The restaurant offered gourmet coffee and cigars after the meal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e5aec0e-c632-4d54-835f-8971da4aac12",
                                                "sense_id": "2ecb1d1d-f78a-3439-bd58-d04af47ada12",
                                                "text": "[On the coffee] Mmm! God damn, Jimmie! This is some serious gourmet shit!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gourmet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f0c8fff-5e43-35ca-958e-70807c0838f5",
                                        "entry_id": "51a1c672-b4fd-3e9e-927f-fca8da74fb6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A connoisseur in eating and drinking; someone who takes their food seriously."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04fa427a-dca3-4b85-b58b-682a927e2942",
                                                "sense_id": "7f0c8fff-5e43-35ca-958e-70807c0838f5",
                                                "text": "The vulvae of the sow were popular as a gourmet's dish. Credited with erotic effects."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
